# Benchmark harness. The Python tools are portable and tracked -- they are how
# the performance claims and the sparse/dense threshold can be reproduced. The
# shell drivers hardcode local interpreter and dataset paths, and the wheel
# cache is a download artifact, so those stay out.
_bench/*.sh
_bench/wheels/
_bench/out_*/
